{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-9","kind":"proposition","title":"一直线求截所取之分","englishTitle":"From a given straight line to cut off a prescribed part.","book":6,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","contentId":"euclid-6-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb2b2081125ebaec8ee36bd7299b3c73b709d2942b0c36a0f1a8b50fef882325","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-9.statement","euclid-6-9.construction.1","euclid-6-9.construction.2","euclid-6-9.construction.3","euclid-6-9.construction.4","euclid-6-9.proof.1","euclid-6-9.proof.2","euclid-6-9.conclusion","euclid-6-9.historical.1","euclid-6-9.historical.2","euclid-6-9.historical.3","euclid-6-9.historical.4","euclid-6-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc3f8d8dbc0f1875a2b0340b0c3fd6b343968e6f7356b89dd69c42e2e283bf67","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From a given straight line to cut off a prescribed part."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从给定的直线切除指定部件 。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求截所取之分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找出直线的线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d247307f3849d678f1095eb1b7e36933375fe53a63404428309517ea5411c01d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line; thus it is required to cut off from AB a prescribed part."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为给定的直线;因此,它必须从指定的部分的AB中截断。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74e356df1c419f55c685fc98c2a7c70bc69a44b574cddbcef2b8c3d4a879082a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the third part be that prescribed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"第三部分应该具体列出。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0bb1eb46511e3042e924a864280c0f604aed364b9ec9e30a0a8958a0b2e8df6","citations":["euclid-1-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a straight line AC be drawn through from A containing with AB any angle; let a point D be taken at random on AC, and let DE, EC be made equal to AD. [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC线线从A线划过,其中任意角为AB;AC点随机取D点,DE、EC点等于AD。 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea1f63ed078ab45d26ecc1ec7e31b3337ef3d1d3acfac12ee83130c002c11134","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be joined, and through D let DF be drawn parallel to it. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BC连接起来,通过D连接,DF连接到它。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"594a1e2a25057ff6d2c780333cd16b65f8b8bdbddef6d7b48b4c6846e0b7934b","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since FD has been drawn parallel to BC, one of the sides of the triangle ABC, therefore, proportionally, as CD is to DA, so is BF to FA. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,FD三角形的侧面被划为BC,因此,CD对DA的比例相当于BF对FA的比例；CD 与 DA 之比等于 BF 与 FA 之比。（相关点与线段：ABC） [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60c1654a6f851bb8752acc16236451a753becfe4542ab2bd7335fb7c1bda456c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD is double of DA; therefore BF is also double of FA; therefore BA is triple of AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CD是DA的两倍;因此,BF也是FA的两倍;因此,BA是AF的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"174719a1074e70fb5be208a3118d98e6226a61926374033a07d9c2ba7bb04cc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore from the given straight line AB the prescribed third part AF has been cut off. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从指定的直线 AB上,已切断了规定的第AF段第三段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a680ca04925526de5b9d1659f09972b4858fac0c092ccc42e13efb478477ae0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求截所取之分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找出直线的线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0747a900ae39bf9735f8332f8e89bc8abbb85225a159cb327480523c2198ace6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙直线求截取三分之一先从甲任作一甲丙线为丙甲乙角次从甲向丙任作所命分之平度如甲丁丁戊戊己为三分也次作己乙直线末作丁庚线与己乙平行即甲庚为甲乙三分之一"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：对于直线 :甲乙，取三分之一。首先，从直线 甲 上画任意三分之一。直线 甲丙 与 丙甲乙 成角。然后，从 甲 到 丙 画指定的水平线。例如，如果 甲丁丁戊戊己 是三分之一，则画直线 己乙。最后，画直线 丁庚，与 己乙 平行，即 甲庚 是 甲乙 的三分之一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8796cceedd29df2077b128f38ea5921b821c4545ae8c7f562041a2500188a66","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙己角形内之丁庚线既与乙己边平行即己丁与丁甲之比例若乙庚与庚甲也〈本篇二〉合之己甲与甲丁若乙甲与庚甲也〈五卷十八〉而甲丁既为己甲三分之一即庚甲亦为乙甲三分之一也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙己，三角形内的直线 丁庚 平行于 乙己 的边，即 己丁 与 丁甲 的比。如果 乙庚 和 庚甲 也是 〈本篇二〉，那么 己甲 和 甲丁 是，则 乙甲 和 庚甲 也为 〈五卷十八〉，并且由于 甲丁 是 己甲 的三分之一，那么 庚甲 也是 乙甲 的三分之一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e7230bb90124e47a66e9a38a738d9fd65440d7e82d4ec7be0682b023e05fc3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：甲乙线欲截取十一分之四先作甲丙线为丙甲乙角从甲向丙任平分十一分至丁次作丁乙线末从甲取四分得戊作戊己线与丁乙平行即甲己为十一分甲乙之四何者依上论丁甲与戊甲之比例若乙甲与己甲也反之甲戊与甲丁若甲己与甲乙也〈五卷四〉甲戊为甲丁十一分之四则甲己亦甲乙十一分之四矣依此可推不尽分之数盖四不为十一之尽分故"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注意：将直线 甲乙 分割为四分之十一，首先画直线 甲丙 作为 丙甲乙 角。从 甲 到 丙，均分为十一等份得到 丁，然后画直线 丁乙，最后从 甲 取四份得到 戊 作为 戊己。直线平行于 丁乙，意味着 甲己 被分为十一等份。甲乙 和 甲乙 呢？根据上述讨论，丁甲 与 戊甲 的比是 乙甲 和 己甲；反之，如果 甲戊 和 甲丁 是 甲己 与 甲乙，〈五卷四〉甲戊 是 甲丁 的四分之十一，那么 甲己 也是四分之十一。由此可以推导出不完整的部分数，因为四不是十一分之一的完整分数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-9.source","contentId":"euclid-6-9","revisionId":"euclid-6-9@raw-bb2b2081125ebaec","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0dc919430e9c87084580fc13d2b6bea7a3eb1af7b4ce5d7476c676559d0588fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-9:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-9.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-9:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-9.construction.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-9:euclid-6-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-9.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VI. 2"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-9:euclid-1-3:explicit","id":"euclid-1-3","book":1,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"从长线段截取与短线段相等的部分","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-9:euclid-